WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:06.400
In the West Tokyo final round of the Gunpla Battle Japanese Championship,

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.730
the winner is team Try Fighters from Seiho Academy.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:22.290
Don't cry.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.750
We have no regrets, since we gave it all we had.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.380
P-President Sudou...

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:31.590
Yomi.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:45.770
Mr. Sudou...

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:46.810
Sekai!

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:48.190
Sekai!

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:49.480
What?

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:53.990
What's the matter, Sekai!?

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:54.820
Sekai!

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:56.110
What is it?

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:00.200
Th-That's...

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:01.950
Could it be...?

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:06.790
Assimilated, huh?

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.710
It's been a while since I saw one.

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:14.090
Someone absorbed by Gunpla,

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:18.050
as much as Iori and I. Or even more so.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:52.860
I'm coming.

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:57.030
Hello, Hoshino.

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:59.950
Sekai...  You're better already?

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.910
Guess I got too psyched up.

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:05.450
But I've recovered completely.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:07.330
Sorry for making you worry.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.080
That's great!

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:11.040
But why come to my house?

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:13.630
I wanted to return this to you.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.670
Please hold on to it, Hoshino.

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:22.720
Because you're president of the Gunpla Battle Club, and leader of the Try Fighters.

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:25.970
Then why not put the trophy in our club room?

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:27.520
As a shared remembrance.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:28.390
Yeah!

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:30.850
Hey, who is this?

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:32.350
Is he your classmate?

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:34.270
He's a junior club member.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:36.690
This is my mother.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:39.440
I'm Kamiki Sekai, middle school second year.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:41.570
Kamiki, eh?

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:43.870
I'm Markia, Fumina's mother.

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:50.160
I bet he'll look great 5 years from now.

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:51.830
Is he perhaps your boyfriend?

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.460
Wh-What are you saying- !?

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:54.580
Yes, that's right.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:55.250
What!?

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.670
I thought so.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.710
S-Sekai, what're you--

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:02.800
A "boyfriend" means a male friend, right?

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:04.800
That might be true, but...

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:08.470
Sekai, don't just stand there. Come in, come in!

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:10.310
I'll treat you to my delicious waffles.

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.270
Really!?

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:12.690
I'd be delighted!

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:16.360
Hey, wait...

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:19.980
Oh well.

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:34.250
<i>You didn't have to come and see me off.</i>

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:38.500
<i>I wanted to say a few words of apology.</i>

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:43.630
<i>I couldn't win with your work, because I wasn't skilled enough as a fighter.</i>

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:45.380
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:49.680
That's not true. It's my fault.

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:52.350
I've been underestimating Kousaka Yuuma.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:54.770
I must admit it.

00:04:55.190 --> 00:05:00.070
His ability as a builder, and my weakness of mind...

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:10.950
We couldn't get to the national tournament, so I have no plans for summer vacation.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.250
I'll just shop and eat.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:17.250
You come with me, got it?

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:17.920
Suga!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:20.170
Sure, my pleasure.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:25.090
You don't have to see me home.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.970
I'm a little worried.

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:29.050
If it isn't Kamiki Sekai!

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:32.890
Suga Akira.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.730
Are you guys on a date, too?

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:42.820
We're just shopping!

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:44.820
That's what she says.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:48.070
Oh yeah, I forgot to tell you.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.280
Congratulations on your win.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:52.410
Oh, thank you!

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.750
Good luck with the nationals, too.

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:58.120
Hey, tell me,

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:01.500
Where did you come across the Jigen Haoh style I use?

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:06.050
You'll see when the national tournament starts.

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:09.760
Let's leave the fun for then.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:11.140
Bye.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:12.310
Suga!

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:14.470
Yes, I'm coming!

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.390
The national tournament...

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:23.980
Mirai, I hear your brother won a Gunpla championship?

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:26.240
Yes, He's representing West Tokyo.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:27.900
How wonderful.

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:29.160
Right, Ms. Hibiki?

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:29.990
Yes.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:33.830
So it's clear Miss Mirai will represent our agency.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.200
Represent where?

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:37.710
That event.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:43.590
"Gun... Colle"?

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:45.630
Gunpla Collection.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:49.550
It's a revolutionary event meant to fuse Gunpla with fashion.

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:53.390
The highlight is a Gunpla Battle between modeling agencies.

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:55.680
A-Are you telling me to...?

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:58.140
This is your chance, Miss Mirai.

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:01.190
Gunpla has now become a worldwide language!

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:08.110
That Hollywood star Mihoshi got to where she is now, by starting off as a Gunpla idol.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:11.280
I don't know anything about Gunpla!

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.410
I've only seen my brother's matches.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:16.580
Then ask him to teach you.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:17.700
Satomi.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:19.910
Miss Mirai! I'm counting on you!

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:23.170
Our agency's future depends on you.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.380
So that's what happened.

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:30.630
A Gunpla Battle between models?

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:31.800
Sounds like fun.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:33.640
What are you saying, Sekai?

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:36.100
I've never built Gunpla before.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:37.930
In that case...

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:41.940
As winner of the Grand Prix in the Artistic Gunpla Contest,

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:46.440
I, Kousaka Yuuma, will do all I can to support you.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:48.400
Kousaka, are you sure?

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.150
Of course!

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:52.030
I'll help you, too--

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:56.660
Hoshino, would you please leave this to me?

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:58.870
Um... Yeah, okay.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:00.580
That would be better.

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:07.000
Then Mirai, tomorrow after school, let's go to G-Muse together to buy Gunpla!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.000
Yes, that'll be great.

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:14.300
I did it!

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:16.970
It won't end just with shopping.

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:19.140
We'll watch a movie, have dinner,

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:23.270
and then go up to a rooftop like Four and Kamille...

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:26.730
Your inner voice is leaking loudly.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:26.730
<b>Your inner voice is leaking loudly.</b>

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:21.910
Hey, Sekai.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:27.420
Aren't you worried about Miss Mirai being alone with Yuu?

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:28.540
Not at all.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.590
My sister's pretty awesome.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:33.380
Awesome? How?

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:34.920
In lots of ways.

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.180
I-It's done.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.560
Yes. It's very well built.

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:47.350
It's all because you taught me so carefully.

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:51.820
You worked hard, so I have a present for you.

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:55.360
The Petit-Beargguy.

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:01.330
It's so cute!

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:06.080
It's not only cute, but also an ace in the hole.

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.120
Thank you, Kousaka.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:11.040
It's I who should thank you.

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:16.590
When I saw you happily building Gunpla, I thought...

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:23.260
I've been caught up in just building beautiful or strong Gunpla.

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:26.600
I'd forgotten how to simply enjoy building it.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:30.020
You reminded me of that, and I appreciate it.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:33.110
Kousaka, you're really earnest.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:38.700
But I think you should just do your best at what you love.

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:40.990
What I love...

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:45.660
I'll try my best with this Gunpla.

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:49.080
And you try your best at the national tournament.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:51.250
Yes.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:53.210
Thank you!

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:04.890
It's time for the Tokyo Gunpla Collection!

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:06.680
Let's go!

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:24.280
Wow, gorgeous!

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.410
So glamourous.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:28.250
Not good at all.

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:31.290
All the Gunpla are built so poorly.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:34.080
Yuu, that's not what you should focus on.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:35.380
Here's my sister.

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.050
Go, big sis!

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:41.510
Beat them all!

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:44.470
Sekai, that's not how you cheer.

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:51.310
Miss Mirai just looked at us.

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:54.650
The Gunpla I helped her build really stands out.

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:56.230
It's much better than the others.

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:58.940
I said that's not what you should focus on.

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:04.780
Miss Mirai, you were stunning!

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:07.030
Thank you, Miss Hoshino.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.330
And now for the Gunpla Battle.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.580
I heard it's officially called a "Gunpla Rally".

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:13.460
Rally?

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.670
It's a race that's staged in nature.

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.680
Who's that flashy guy?

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:27.720
He's Taku, leader of the popular rock group SGOCK III.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:30.600
Didn't you see his special live concert earlier?

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.140
It was a great stage.

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:38.730
Looking at you, gorgeous, sweet phrases came to me.

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:40.030
Th-Thank you.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:40.820
What's your name?

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:42.440
I-I'm K-Kamiki Mirai.

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:46.200
Okay, I'll clear it with your office.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.700
After the event, let's go out to eat together.

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:52.040
To make a good song, I have to know more about you.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:54.870
Aren't you being a bit too pushy?

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.080
I can be as pushy as I want.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:58.540
Because...

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:01.050
I'm a celebrity.

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:01.920
That's why.

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:03.630
He's rather full of himself.

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:06.260
Okay, you can take my sister out.

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:07.550
Sekai?

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:09.640
Who are you to say that?

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:10.430
But!

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:14.140
First you have to win the upcoming Gunpla Battle!

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:18.190
Okay, Let's do it!

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:23.360
Just so you know, I love the Gundam series more than food and drink.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:27.070
And my Gunpla building skills would scare away the pros.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:28.280
Huh!?

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:29.450
This guy...

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:31.200
He's the real deal?

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:36.500
I'm looking forward to the Gunpla Rally, Mirai.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:38.830
Sekai!?

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:40.420
Don't you worry.

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:42.630
My sister isn't just for show.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:47.180
She's totally freaking out.

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:52.720
And now for today's main event!

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:57.480
A Gunpla Rally between modeling agencies!

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:00.480
<i>Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:03.110
<i>Field 3, Forest.</i>

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:07.570
<i>The players must run this course without using flight functions.</i>

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:11.740
<i>The first one to reach the goal will be the winner.</i>

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:17.580
As an unofficial guest, Taku, the leader of SGOCK III, will participate!

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:20.710
Cool, Taku!

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:22.630
Show us your tears of time!

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:22.630
<b>Show us your tears of time!</b>

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:24.630
Good luck, Mirai!

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:26.590
Miss Mirai, I'm counting on you!

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:30.930
Will Miss Mirai be alright?

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:34.810
Her Mama-Beargguy has higher performance than the others.

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:35.970
But...

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:38.020
<i>Please set your Gunpla.</i>

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:42.230
<i>We don't know the performance of that guy's Gunpla, the Turn A.</i>

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:44.820
<i>Battle start.</i>

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:48.950
Kamiki Mirai, Beargguy, here I go!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:02.750
Mirai's Gunpla is--

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:12.850
Wh-What!?

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:16.140
Miss Mirai has good control.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:18.020
We did special training last night.

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:21.150
See? I said my sister is awesome.

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:22.560
I have to hurry.

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:25.150
Mirai's Gunpla is in front.

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:27.070
That's good. Keep it like that.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.610
I won't let you go further!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.110
Hey, audience!

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:35.330
What!?

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:37.950
They're attacking her?

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.660
it can't be. It's a race.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.420
Mr. Taku, if I beat that Gunpla...

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.420
<b>Mr. Taku, if I beat that Gunpla...</b>

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:47.090
I'll go on a date with you, whenever you wish.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:15:59.980
Mirai!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:15:59.980
<b>Mirai!</b>

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:00.770
Big sis!

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:02.230
No! This fine!

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:07.190
The Beargguy II, Mama-Beargguy's base, is an amphibous mobile suit.

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:12.400
If it's underwater, it'll work better.

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:17.780
Moreover, by cutting across the lake, it can drastically shorten the course.

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.450
The other machines can't catch up to it anymore.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.710
Hey, what's that splash?

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:24.500
That's...!

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:26.960
It's using the shield as a surfboard.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:31.720
I told you. Gunpla building is my specialty!

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:39.180
It's about time to go up onto the sandbank.

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.490
H-How!?

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:57.030
I'll tell you in detail when we go on our date.

00:16:57.030 --> 00:17:00.870
Why are you attacking me? Isn't this a race?

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:04.870
Attacking is a strategy for winning.

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:14.590
What's that little thing?

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:19.010
There's no doubt it's my enemy, too.

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:29.400
No!

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:42.830
Big sis!

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:43.540
Miss Mirai!

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:43.540
<b>Miss Mirai!</b>

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:44.120
Mirai!

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:44.120
<b>Mirai!</b>

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:50.170
Mama-Beargguy...

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.970
The Gunpla that Kousaka...

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:56.800
helped me to build.

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:04.890
No time to be sentimental.

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:08.060
I won't get careless even if you're small!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.070
Wh-What happened?

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:27.580
That's...

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:28.540
It can't be happening.

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:29.960
It is happening!

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:34.250
I can feel it from your fist.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.170
Your evil feelings.

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:41.640
I can feel your mean spirit!

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:44.680
Romance is just fodder for my art!

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:49.020
After all, I'm a celebrity.

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:52.810
Where is it!?

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:07.330
Jigen Haoh style!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.920
Soten Guren-Ken!

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:17.090
Ouch!

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:20.630
Ro...

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:22.760
Ro...

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:28.850
Rock 'n' roll!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.190
Th-That technique...

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.190
<b>Th-That technique...</b>

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:33.020
Yeah.

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:36.360
When she was younder, my sister took lessons, too.

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:39.150
The Jigen Haoh style!

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:43.370
Head straight for the goal, sis!

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.630
Please, Mr. Petit-Beargguy!

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:03.590
The goal is on the other side.

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:06.100
Then, the winner is...

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:07.810
Miss Mirai!

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:33.250
Goal!

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:40.170
The winner is the hot mama, Ms. Karin from DR Production!

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:42.920
N-No...

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:42.920
<b>N-No...</b>

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.970
No way!

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.970
<b>No way!</b>

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:54.140
It's a pity you weren't able to win.

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:56.860
No, I guess this was the right result.

00:20:57.190 --> 00:21:00.360
Ms. Karin, the winner, was simply doing the race.

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:02.440
That wasn't true of me.

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:03.900
But that's because...

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:09.490
No matter what the reason, evil feelings give others an opening.

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:12.080
That's what the Jigen Haoh style teaches.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:14.410
I'll bear that in mind.

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:21.130
It's been so stressful today, I'm hungry now.

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:23.920
Kousaka, do you want to go to dinner with me?

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:26.180
Is that okay?

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:27.300
Of course.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:30.680
Is it your treat?

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:32.100
Sekai.

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:34.100
Yes, it's my treat.

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:35.140
Yes!

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:41.860
I thought it was a dinner just for Mirai and I.

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:46.280
I hate it when little kids keep getting in the way.

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:49.950
Yuu, your inner voice...

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:51.370
...it's leaking loudly again.

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:29.800
It seems Seiho Academy will represent West Tokyo.

00:23:30.550 --> 00:23:35.100
However ill-prepared his team was, I can't believe that Sleggar lost.

00:23:35.430 --> 00:23:39.140
Coach Allan. There are no absolutes in Gunpla Battle.

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:42.560
The weaker guys lost.

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:44.440
That's simply what happened.

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:45.900
Adou...

00:23:46.690 --> 00:23:51.700
Suga Akira is only a substitute for when I'm not there. He's not that big a deal.

00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:55.490
I'll show them at the national tournament.

00:23:56.280 --> 00:23:58.580
The strength of Adou Saga.

00:24:00.370 --> 00:24:02.500
The training camp before the national tournament.

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:04.830
The facility Mr. Ral take us to...

00:24:04.830 --> 00:24:06.500
Next Episode, "Nielsen Labs".

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:09.260
Many fateful encounters are waiting for us there.
